Description: FluorineOS AMOLED Hyprland desktop environment
 FluorineOS desktop configuration for Hyprland 0.55 and later, built on a
 pure AMOLED black base with a reactive lime accent.
 .
 The package installs the native Lua compositor configuration, Waybar,
 Kitty, Fuzzel, and SwayNotificationCenter themes, the hypridle idle policy
 and hyprlock lock screen, hardware media and brightness key bindings,
 cliphist clipboard history, and the flr-shot, flr-keys, flr-doctor, and
 flr-onboard command line utilities.
 .
 Hardware integration covers NetworkManager connections through nmtui, the
 Bluetooth manager, power profile cycling through power-profiles-daemon, and
 automatic external display layouts through kanshi.
 .
 flr-ctl provides a single keyboard-driven system menu in Fuzzel for network,
 Bluetooth, display, audio, power, diagnostics, and session actions, and
 flr-update refreshes APT metadata, lists incoming FluorineOS and security
 upgrades, and reports whether a reboot is required.
 .
 Configuration is installed into /etc/skel/.config so that newly created
 users receive the FluorineOS desktop on first login. The first interactive
 login shows the keybinding cheat sheet once.

